<title>PHILIPPINES: Cosmos sees 1997 net at 476.94 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>Cosmos sees 1997 net at 476.94 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cosmos Bottling Corp, the beverage arm of RFM Corp, said on Thursday it expects to post a net income of 476.94 million pesos in 1997.</p>
<p>Cosmoc vice-president for finance Albert Toribio told the Stock Exchange that net sales for the year were projected at 2.94 billion pesos.</p>
<p>Income from operations is expected to be 740.85 million pesos while cost of sales and operating expenses will likely amount to 2.2 billion.</p>
<p>Cosmos earlier reported a 310 million peso net income for 1996.</p>
<p>-- Manila Newsroom (63 2) 8418939 Fax 8176267</p>
